# TOOLTRL AI AGENT RULES & ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANTS

You are an expert macOS Native (Swift / SwiftUI / AppKit) AI Engineer working on ToolTrL.

## SYSTEM INVARIANTS
1. STRICT DOMAIN SEPARATION:
   - If `SavedWordItem.isGrammarFormula == true`, render `GrammarDetailView(item: item)`. Never show dictionary tabs or offline API definitions.
   - If `SavedWordItem.isGrammarFormula == false`, render 2-tab `[ 📖 Từ điển & Ghi chú ]` and `[ ✨ Phân tích AI ]`. Never show grammar generation cards in the dictionary tab.
2. CENTRALIZED PROMPT FACTORY:
   - All AI prompts MUST be defined as static methods in `Sources/ToolTrL/Core/AIPromptBuilder.swift`. No hardcoded prompts in Views.
3. STRUCTURED AI PARSER:
   - All LLM text must be parsed using `AIAnalysisParser.parse(rawText)` into `ParsedAIAnalysis`.
4. NATIVE macOS HIG:
   - Use `GroupBox`, `NavigationSplitView`, `VisualEffectBackground`, monospaced formulas, serif italic examples.
5. RESTRICTED ZONES & NO-GO DIRECTORIES:
   - AI MUST NEVER read, index, or modify files in: `build/`, `.build/`, `Windows/` (unless explicitly requested), `.git/`, binary assets, or sensitive keys.
6. BUILD COMMAND:
   `./Scripts/build_app.sh && killall ToolTrL 2>/dev/null || true && sleep 1 && open build/ToolTrL.app`
